<title>MEXICO: Mexico's ARA to launch up to $60 mln global IPO.</title>
<headline>Mexico's ARA to launch up to $60 mln global IPO.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction consortium ARA said Thursday it would launch an initial public offering of up to $60 million in Mexico, the United States and Europe.</p>
<p>&quot;It's expected to be around $50 million to $60 million,&quot; consortium president German Ahumanda said during a road show.</p>
<p>He said it would be a &quot;global offer, of which 30 percent will be issued in Mexico and 70 percent in the United States and Eurpoe, led by Salomon Brothers.&quot;</p>
</text>
